{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263OrAZbRwdz1792673001.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地機械人龍頭企業宇樹科技推出一款人形機械人，識得打功夫，還夠力抬起汽車救人。</p><p></p><p>空翻、騰空肘擊、連環腿，多個高難度動作行雲流水。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_ROBOT_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kQ9WSopR9q1792668960.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>這個身高182厘米、體重約70公斤的「大隻佬」，就是宇樹科技新推出的「H2-X功夫傳奇守護」人形機械人，它能從4米高台跳下完成後滾翻平穩落地。在危機時刻能挺身而出，同持刀襲擊者近身搏鬥，還可以徒手抬起汽車，救出車底的被困者，主打防護及應急避險等能力。電池續航最長可達8小時，片段中強調是全程實拍。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ROBOT-1830_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pxyk6jdnnA1792669080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>有別於之前在春晚，以及北京天壇公園展示的表演機械人，宇樹指今次推出的「H2-X」機械人具有處理應急救援的能力，不過片段中有提示跟同這款機械人保持2至3米安全距離。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:21:41.769210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:13.929171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:51.632799+00:00","content_hash":"cd8b996d20d2812800f7eb7f39cc33bc1c759de6255ad9eb73556e3b8154a786","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:21:41.769210+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}